   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 7433,
   "text": "If you cannot find your transcript, the answer is nearly always that somebody has to switch it on \u2014 and on most\ntools that somebody is not you. Verified against vendor docs 2026-08-02; plan and admin details go stale fast.",
